            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.9.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 9:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.31.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 31:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.28.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 28:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima omukono gwa MUKAMA gwahingamira abantu ba Ashidoodi n'ab'omu butegyeki bwayo; yaabatiinisa, kandi yaababonabonesa n'ebizimba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ba Ashidoodi ku baarebire byaba bityo, baagira bati: Eshanduukye ya Ruhanga wa Israeli etaguma naitwe; ahabw'okuba omukono gwe gutuhingamiire na ruhanga waitu Dagoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo kutuma abategyeki b'Abafilistia boona kuteeranira hamwe, bakagira bati: Tugire tuta eshanduukye ya Ruhanga wa Israeli? Baabagarukamu bati: Eshanduukye ya Ruhanga wa Israeli mugyohererezane, ehikye Gaasi. Batyo baayohererezana eshanduukye ya Ruhanga wa Israeli, baagihitsyayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.2.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 2:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.7.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 7:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.78.66"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 78:66",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima ku baaherize kugihitsyayo, omukono gwa MUKAMA gwarwanisa orwo rurembo, yaabahahaaza emitima munonga; yaarwaza abanyarurembo, abato n'abakuru, ebizimba aha mibiri yaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo eshanduukye ya Ruhanga baagyohereza Ekurooni; aba Ekurooni ku baagicwire eriisho neija, baayombera kimwe nibagira bati: Boohererezaine eshanduukye ya Ruhanga wa Israeli, mbwenu baagituhitsyaho kutwita n'abantu baitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo baatuma abategyeki b'Abafilistia boona, baateeranira aho, aba Ekurooni baabagira bati: Mwohereze eshanduukye ya Ruhanga wa Israeli, egarukye omu mwanya gwayo, erekye kutwita n'abantu baitu. Ahabw'okuba omuri orwo rurembo rwona hakaba hariho okuhahaaza emitima ahabw'okutiina kufa; n'omukono gwa MUKAMA gubahingamiire munonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.11.6"
